[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0010","text":"雨停了真好呢……！\n练舞的时候，下了好一阵子……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0020","text":"是呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0030","text":"雏菜今天没带伞，\n所以超级幸运～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0040","text":"啊，原来是这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0050","text":"雏、雏菜酱……！\n脚下有水坑，小心点哦？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0060","text":"啊哈～，这个水坑好大呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0070","text":"嗯、嗯……！\n因为很大，所以映出了天空……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0080","text":"啊哈～\n小糸酱的脸也映出来了呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0090","text":"真的耶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0100","text":"嗯～，感觉不错～♡"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300300_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
